  "description": {
    "en": "Wilson NXT Power 17 is a premium power-oriented multifilament formerly known as NXT Tour. It uses high-crystallinity Xycro microfibers bonded with polyurethane to deliver a soft, comfortable and explosive response, while a ribbon-like co-polymer core improves tensile strength and helps reduce tension loss. Wilson reports a 15% larger sweet spot and 80% less vibration than traditional synthetic gut. At 1.26 mm / 17 gauge, it sits between the 1.30 mm NXT Power 16 and the 1.21 mm NXT Power 18, offering a balanced combination of power, feel, comfort and durability.",

    "zh": "Wilson NXT Power 17 是一款以力量、舒适和手感为核心的高端多芯球线，原名 NXT Tour。它采用高结晶度 Xycro 微纤维并通过 Polyurethane 聚氨酯结合，带来柔软、舒适且具有爆发力的击球反馈；Ribbon-Like Co-Polymer Core 则用于提升抗拉强度并减少张力流失。Wilson 表示它相比传统 Synthetic Gut 拥有约 15% 更大的 Sweet Spot，并减少约 80% 的震动。1.26 毫米 / 17 Gauge 位于 1.30 毫米 NXT Power 16 和 1.21 毫米 NXT Power 18 之间，是整个系列中力量、手感、舒适与耐久较平衡的版本。"
  },

